    "message": "refactor(git-utils): use time for Git baseline UTC commit seconds\n\nReplace the sole Chrono Utc clock read with OffsetDateTime::now_utc().unix_timestamp(), preserving signed Unix seconds and zero Git timezone offset. Replace the direct git-utils Chrono dependency with the existing workspace time dependency, and update its Cargo.lock dependency list only.\n\nIncremental RUSTSEC-2026-0543 dependency removal; transitive and other first-party Chrono consumers remain. Requires exact-head Cargo/Bazel lock and platform CI. Preserve all existing failure gates and the Rust fallback.",
